{"_id":"6a2ffacb2204ffbc59e5a885","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"EHVXO79NGpLC1i8x4Y7g1","description":"# Power BI / Tableau\n\nPower BI and Tableau are enterprise BI platforms for building interactive dashboards and reports. Python integrates with both: Power BI supports Python visuals and data transformation scripts, and Tableau supports Python through TabPy for custom calculations. Analysts who prepare data in Python can visualize and distribute it through these platforms for business audiences.","resources":[{"type":"video","title":"Power BI Tutorials for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLUaB-1hjhk8HqnmK0gQhfmIdCbxwoAoys","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb72"},{"type":"video","title":"Learn Tableau in Under 2 hours","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j8FSP8XuFyk","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb73"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:14:51.742Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/EHVXO79NGpLC1i8x4Y7g1.md"}